  "note": "The official PnL uses a conservative 1,000ms entry and exit landing model. A 170ms Helius-style fast-path snapshot is diagnostic only because transport latency is not guaranteed end-to-end inclusion latency. Active migration dumps are rejected and every intervening wallet/flow is recorded."
